<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Online Customer Support | Helpdesk</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: #f4f6f9;
      color: #333;
    }

    header {
      background: #0a3d62;
      color: #fff;
      padding: 25px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    header h1 {
      margin: 0;
      font-size: 26px;
    }

    header p {
      margin-top: 8px;
      font-size: 15px;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    .container {
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 30px 20px;
    }

    .card {
      background: #fff;
      padding: 25px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      margin-bottom: 25px;
    }

    .card h2 {
      margin-top: 0;
      color: #0a3d62;
    }

    .services {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .service-box {
      background: #f8f9fb;
      padding: 18px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      text-align: center;
      border: 1px solid #e1e5ee;
    }

    .contact-buttons {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 15px;
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .btn {
      text-decoration: none;
      padding: 15px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-weight: bold;
      text-align: center;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .call {
      background: #007bff;
    }

    .whatsapp {
      background: #25D366;
    }

    footer {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 20px;
      font-size: 14px;
      color: #777;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
  <h1>Online Customer Support Helpdesk</h1>
  <p>24/7 Assistance | Trusted Support Services</p>
</header>

<div class="container">

  <div class="card">
    <h2>About Our Support</h2>
    <p>
      We provide professional online customer support services to help users
      with account guidance, general inquiries, and technical assistance.
      Our goal is to offer fast, reliable, and secure help.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>Our Services</h2>
    <div class="services">
      <div class="service-box">✔ General Customer Support</div>
      <div class="service-box">✔ Online Assistance</div>
      <div class="service-box">✔ Account Help Guidance</div>
      <div class="service-box">✔ 24/7 Call & WhatsApp Support</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="card">
    <h2>Contact Support Team</h2>
    <p>
      For immediate assistance, call or message our support team.
    </p>

    <div class="contact-buttons">
      <a class="btn call" href="tel:+918102635385">
        📞 Call Now: 8102635385
      </a>

      <a class="btn whatsapp" href="https://wa.me/918102635385" target="_blank">
        💬 WhatsApp Support
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>

<footer>
  © 2026 Online Support Helpdesk. All rights reserved.
</footer>

</body>
</html>
